<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">Receive a comprehensive approach during an appointment</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Doctor’s consultation</h3><span class="scroll-block-item__aside u-text-headings-small">60 €</span></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– Doctor’s consultation that includes finding out your wishes and ascertaining your goals.<br>
– Dr. Aleksejevs will ask you questions about your prior experience and possible fears.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">State-of-the-art examinations</h3><span class="scroll-block-item__aside u-text-headings-small">230 €</span></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– 3D X-ray to digitize the skull and hard tissues<br>
– 3D Shape scanner — for precise digitization of teeth (for both jaws)<br>
– 3D computed tomography (CSDT)<br>
– Photo protocol to record the structure and features of the patient’s face both intra-orally and extra-orally<br>
– Modjaw jaw movement recording device</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Second appointment: treatment plan presentation</h3><span class="scroll-block-item__aside u-text-headings-small">120 €</span></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">– A step-by-step plan for the creation of your perfect smile: the team of eight doctors prepares a plan with a long-term vision of what should be done to achieve the specific goal<br>
– Precise costs are specified in the plan<br>
– Precise and achievable timeframes are set</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">DSD — Digital smile design</h3><span class="scroll-block-item__aside u-text-headings-small">120 €</span></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">- The opportunity to view your perfect smile even before the start of treatment.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Special offer for complex diagnostics available until the end of the month</h2><!----><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--old u-text-headings-small">€650</span><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">€280</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block service-apply u-bg-primary service-apply--layout-default complex-diagnostics-page__apply"><div class="reveal-block__content"><div class="reveal-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title u-text-headings-large"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">What</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">happens</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">during</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">your</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">first</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">appointment</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">at</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">our</span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true" style="display: inline-block;">clinic?</span><span class="sr-only" style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0px, 0px, 0px, 0px); white-space: nowrap; border: 0px;">What happens during your first appointment at our clinic?</span></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="reveal-block__body u-bg-secondary" style="background-color:#031C14;"><div class="reveal-block__bg"><canvas class="lava-bg-illustration reveal-block__bg-illustration" width="1920" height="1230"></canvas><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><p class="reveal-block__title reveal-block__title--bg u-text-headings-large">What happens during your first appointment at our clinic?</p><!--]--></div></div><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="reveal-block__main-wrap"><div class="reveal-block__main"><!--[--><div class="service-apply-grid"><div class="service-apply-grid__item service-apply-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="service-apply-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover service-apply-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="250" height="250" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/lava_kā_notiek_diagnostika_teaser2.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="service-apply-box__body"><p class="u-text-headings-small">What happens during your first appointment at our clinic?</p><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end service-apply-box__cta-button"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline"><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--intro"></div><div class="reveal-block__timeline-item reveal-block__timeline-item--main"></div></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">Smile rehabilitation plan</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/ee4bfaab940d-1.avif 1x, /assets/img/717428da8f47-1.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/ee4bfaab940d-1.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/781f5b35bf42-2.avif 1x, /assets/img/889f522ac1bd-2.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/781f5b35bf42-2.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">During the first appointment, the doctor will not only examine the state of your oral cavity and teeth.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">He will also compile the required treatment plan and prepare a plan for the reconstruction of your perfect smile.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Smile rehabilitation is performed so that your smile matches your facial features and improves your overall visual appearance.</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">Digital smile design creation — allows you to view your future smile before the start of treatment.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="service-benefits u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__benefits"><div class="wheel-block"><div class="wheel-block__sticky-content"><div class="wheel-block__header"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Your smile starts here<!--]--></h2><!--]--></div></div><div class="wheel-block__body"><div class="wheel-block__body-inner"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1202" height="1202" viewBox="0 0 1202 1202" fill="none" class="wheel-block-wheel__svg" style="--wheel-rotation-degrees-start:72deg;"><circle cx="600" cy="600" r="534.5" stroke="#DDEFDE" opacity=".2"></circle><!--[--><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(0 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">1</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(72 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">2</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(144 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">3</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(216 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">4</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(288 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">5</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><!--]--></svg><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">More personal than personal</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Your treatment plan coordinator will help you to understand the course of treatment individually and with genuine concern, and will keep track of your progress every step the way along your path to a perfect smile.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Focusing on what matters to you</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Letting you focus on your health — your caring coordinator will take care of all the organisational details.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">More time for yourself</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">With a personal approach, your coordinator will help to arrange your appointment schedule, and provide you with all the information you need to enjoy complete peace of mind.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Between you and your doctor</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">With sincere and professional care, the coordinator will be your reliable point of contact with the doctor, helping to solve questions with no need for unnecessary appointments.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Caring for you</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">The coordinator will follow all stages of the treatment with genuine interest, making sure that everything happens promptly and properly.</p></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="wheel-block__triggers"><!--[--><div data-nr="1" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="2" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="3" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="4" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="5" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="service-apply-callout u-bg-primary complex-diagnostics-page__apply-callout"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-apply-callout__title">Make a comprehensive diagnostic appointment and take a step towards your perfect smile!</h2><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></section>
<section id="portfolio" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-portfolio;"><!--[--><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-portfolio"><div class="portfolio-story u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__story"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-story__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our patient’s story on the way to the Perfect Smile<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-story__body"><div class="portfolio-story-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="portfolio-story-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover portfolio-story-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="640" height="1138" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/sales-story-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="portfolio-story-box__body"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><h3>Goal</h3>
<p>To improve the appearance of my smile, I was concerned about the existing composite coatings on the front teeth (fillings), which were worn, cracked, and discoloured.</p>
<h3>What we did</h3>
<ul>
<li>We performed comprehensive diagnostics – collecting the patient’s history, followed by oral cavity and teeth examination, 3 Shape scan, intraoral digital X-rays, KSDT (3D X-ray), photo protocol, facial analysis;</li>
<li>We prepared a personalised treatment plan, including all the required finances, implementation time, and also demonstrated a digital smile design, during which the patient was able to view before/after pictures of her smile before we started any treatment process.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Result</h3>
<p>Treatment duration 3 months:</p>
<ul>
<li>We replaced 2 missing teeth with Straumann implants,</li>
<li>We performed endodontic root canal treatment under microscope control, therapeutic treatment and smile reconstruction with 24 ceramic veneers, which were made in our technical laboratory in Dubai.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__examples"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Examples of our work<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-examples__body"><div class="portfolio-examples-list"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915d5781ff8253e21798ef7"><div><div id="szcnp4drz" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pēc-8-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-9-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We were approached by a patient who was upset by the dark colour of her two front teeth. These teeth had been rendered lifeless by previous trauma and had already been subjected to root canal treatment. The patient wished to retain her natural appearance, while undergoing the least invasive dental correction possible.</p><h3><strong>Treatment plan</strong></h3><p>Our team focused on the patient's six front teeth only, in so doing adopting the most caring and gentle approach as possible:</p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1"><strong>360° veneers</strong> were prepared for two dead teeth, completely covering the teeth and concealing their dark tone,</li><li class="" style="" value="2">for the other four teeth, <strong>non-prep veneers</strong> were made, retaining the natural tooth tissue beneath them.</li></ul><p>To achieve a consistent colour tone and natural transition, we initially performed professional teeth whitening with the <strong>Flash system</strong>, which is one of the safest and most effective methods for whitening natural teeth, as well as replacing old composite fillings and repairing damage.</p><h3><strong>Aesthetic solution</strong></h3><p>After whitening, a new tooth tone was determined and then chosen as the basis for the preparation of the veneers. The veneers were made in our partner laboratory in Dubai, where master ceramists manually crafted the relief and translucency of each tooth. This ensured that the veneers complemented the patient’s natural teeth perfectly.</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The end result was a harmonious and natural appearance – the patient's two dead teeth were successfully concealed, while her new smile was bright, consistent and visually appealing. The patient's dream came true – she now has a natural and assured smile.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915eed8f3394b8d6b4afdce"><div><div id="nfo0bax3v" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/4pēc-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/4pirms-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Complete smile reconstruction and renewed function of teeth</strong></h2><p>A patient came to our clinic who had spent over a decade living with metal-ceramic crowns on her front teeth and missing her lateral teeth. Over time, her crowns and gum area had become inflamed, while her missing lateral abutment teeth had altered her bite. This not only affected her chewing function, but the look of her smile and even her facial proportions.</p><h3><strong>Goal and treatment strategy</strong></h3><p>Our team's main goal was to comprehensively restore the health and functionality the patient's oral cavity and the beauty of her smile. We performed all the treatment at the LAVA Dental Studio, with the participation of six specialists during each stage, including an implantologist, surgeon, prosthodontist, therapist, endodontist and hygienist. This interdisciplinary approach enabled us to provide the patient with the most effective, orderly and comfortable treatment.</p><h3><strong>State-of-the-art technology and digital planning</strong></h3><p>Throughout the treatment process, we used the very latest high precision digital technology:<br>● intraoral 3D scanning,<br>● computed tomography,<br>● digital smile modelling.</p><p>This enabled us to plan each step carefully and show the expected result to the patient before treatment had even begun. This approach ensured a clear and transparent process, thus gave the patient complete confidence in the final solution.</p><h3><strong>Comprehensive restoration</strong></h3><p>After complete dental treatment and gum correction, we replaced the patient's missing teeth with Swiss-made <strong>Straumann</strong> implants. The final stage was the preparation and installation of natural ceramic crowns. These completely restored the patient's correct bite, the harmony of her smile, and natural facial lines, including the proportions of her lip rests and lower face.</p><h3><strong>Result&nbsp;</strong></h3><p>The entire process took 14 months and turned out to be a great example of how a combination of the very latest technologies and coordinated teamwork make it possible to achieve excellent results. As a result, the patient acquired not only a healthy and functional bite, but also new confidence, natural confidence and an aesthetically harmonious overall image.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915ef59f3394b8d6b4afdd0"><div><div id="vs2wc15fi" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/3pēc-1-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/3pirms-1-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: complete smile reconstruction with ceramic veneers</strong></h2><p>The patient came to us with a number of lateral teeth missing, as well as aesthetic problems in the incisor area. Her smile appeared incomplete, which not only impaired the functionality of her teeth but also the visual harmony of the face.</p><h3><strong>Treatment stages</strong></h3><p><strong>1. Implantology and bone tissue renewal</strong></p><p><strong>Bone augmentation with biomaterial</strong> was performed in those areas where the patient's lateral teeth were missing, followed by the insertion of premium quality Swiss-made <strong>Straumann</strong> implants. These provide longevity, stability, and a stable foundation for future restoration.</p><p><strong>2. Preservation and renewal of existing teeth</strong></p><p>We preserved and fully renewed the patient's existing teeth. Our specialists performed therapeutic and endodontic treatment, eradicating infected areas and restoring her teeth to good health.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>3. Aesthetic reconstruction with ceramic veneers</strong></p><p><strong>Ceramic veneers</strong>, handcrafted in our partner laboratory in Dubai, were installed on the front teeth. They gave the teeth a natural appearance, a harmonious shape, and visually corrected the position of the teeth without the need for orthodontic treatment.</p><h3><strong>Digital smile planning</strong></h3><p>The whole treatment process was based on <strong>digital smile planning</strong>, enabling the patient to visualise the planned result before treatment and giving her confidence in her chosen solution.</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The patient not only acquired healthy teeth and a renewed chewing function, but also a harmonious, visually attractive smile. Thanks to ceramic veneers, we not only altered the tone and form of her teeth, but also their visual arrangement, creating a completely restored, aesthetically pleasing smile, with no need for orthodontic treatment.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915efd6f3394b8d6b4afdd2"><div><div id="oa064cbqe" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/3pēc-2-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/3pirms-2-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
      <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="29.5" fill="#031C14" stroke="#031C14"></circle>
      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(3, 28, 20); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: complete smile reconstruction with ceramic veneers</strong></h2><p>The patient underwent a complete reconstruction of her entire dental row – 28 teeth – using E-max ceramic veneers, which were custom-designed in our partner laboratory in Dubai.&nbsp;</p><p>This is a testament to the highest precision and craftsmanship – not only were the natural form, tone, and relief of the patient's teeth restored, but she now has a harmonious, visually pleasing smile individually tailored to complement her facial features.</p><h3><strong>Preparatory phase</strong></h3><p>Before we applied the veneers, we performed therapeutic and endodontic treatment to ensure the health and stability of the patient's teeth. Digital smile planning was vitally important, as it enabled the patient to visualise the planned outcome before the start of treatment, giving her confidence in her chosen solution.</p><h3><strong>Restoration phase</strong></h3><p>Reconstruction of the patient's smile with ceramic veneers was completed in three weeks, while the whole reconstruction process from preparation to final stabilisation took three months.&nbsp;</p><p>The veneers were made to reflect the patient's individual characteristics and with precise reproduction of translucency, relief and tone, ensuring the most natural and harmonious visual look.</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The patient acquired a natural, attractive and aesthetically attractive smile that not only improves her outer appearance, but also gives her confidence and comfort in her daily life.</p></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples__footer"><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></section><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="process" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-process;"><div class="process-team u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->First-time clients are received by<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Aleksejevs" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Vladislavs Aleksejevs</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Clinic Head, Dentist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Vladislavs&nbsp;worked in the field of dentistry since 2014. A graduate of Riga Stradiņš University's Faculty of Dentistry,&nbsp;he studied inorganic chemistry at Harvard University.&nbsp;In 2018, he founded LAVA dental practice in Ludza. Two years later, in 2020, he founded LAVA dental studio in Riga.&nbsp;He specialises in aesthetic, digital dentistry and smile makeovers using veneers and&nbsp;regularly attends conferences and training courses in Latvia and abroad.&nbsp;You can find out more about Dr. Vladislavs' accomplishments in dentistry and everyday life on his Instagram page: @dr.aleksejevs</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Limonova" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Limonova_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Alisa Ļimonova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Dentist, Therapist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Alisa has worked in the field of dentistry since 2015. A graduate of Riga Stradiņš University's Faculty of Dentistry.Specialises in endodontics (root canal treatment) and treats root canals of various complexity under microscope control. Regularly attends conferences and training courses both in Latvia and abroad.</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our coordinators will take care of the treatment process<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image process-team-member__image" alt="Elina" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Elīna Volkova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Treatment Plan Coordinator</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">A graduate of Riga's “Victoria” Vocational Secondary School, Elīna specialises in customer service and administrative work. Parallel to her job at LAVA Dental Studio, she is studying for a Bachelor’s degree in International Marketing and Sales Management, improving her knowledge in the field of communication and management.&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image process-team-member__image" alt="Viktorija Griševa" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Viktorija Griševa</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Administrator, Treatment Plans Coordinator&nbsp;</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">At LAVA Dental Studio, Viktorija combines administrative duties with the role of treatment plan coordinator, helping patients to go through the entire treatment process step by step safely and confidently.&nbsp;
A balanced and internally strong personality, Viktorija remains calm in even the most difficult situations, invariably finding the most appropriate solution. She encourages patients and helps to coordinate the course of treatment in accordance with their wishes and means, ensuring that they have a well-planned and comfortable experience.&nbsp;</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-feedback" id="feedback" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-feedback;"><div class="feedback-reviews u-bg-primary section-feedback__reviews"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-reviews__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Reviews<!--]--></h2></div><div class="feedback-reviews__body"><div class="feedback-reviews-box"><div class="feedback-reviews-box__content"><!--[--><div class="feedback-review-item" style=""><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>They use a modern and effective cleaning method,&nbsp;and my&nbsp;teeth&nbsp;now&nbsp;feel great.&nbsp;The option&nbsp;to choose additional services.&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;definitely recommend&nbsp;it!&nbsp;5/5 stars!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Eduards</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I&nbsp;visited&nbsp;this dental clinic for professional oral hygiene and was&nbsp;extremely satisfied.&nbsp;The staff&nbsp;are&nbsp;kind and&nbsp;helpful, the atmosphere is calm and pleasant.&nbsp;The hygienist worked very carefully and gently, explaining&nbsp;the whole process,&nbsp;and&nbsp;giving&nbsp;useful tips for oral health.After the&nbsp;treatment,&nbsp;my teeth became clean and fresh. It was a&nbsp;great&nbsp;feeling!&nbsp;I’d definitely recommend this clinic to anyone who wants high-quality&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional care.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Jeļena Gžibovska</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>After my first visit to this clinic, I’m&nbsp;finally no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;scared of going to the dentist. Perfect!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Monta Mineiķe</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I visited Lava Dental Studio for a comprehensive diagnosis –&nbsp;it was&nbsp;a very professional and pleasant experience!&nbsp;From the&nbsp;very&nbsp;first moment I felt that I was in good hands – the staff were&nbsp;kind, explained&nbsp;everything&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;to me, and the examination was carried out carefully and with modern equipment.</p><p>I’m now&nbsp;waiting for&nbsp;my&nbsp;next&nbsp;appointment, when&nbsp;I’ll receive a personalised treatment plan, but I can already say –&nbsp;the&nbsp;level of service&nbsp;is very high&nbsp;and&nbsp;I get the&nbsp;feeling that they really care about each patient.</p><p>I definitely recommend&nbsp;them&nbsp;to anybody&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;high-quality dental services in Riga!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Silvestrs Vaitkevics</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I’m one of those people who WAS very&nbsp;scared&nbsp;of the dentist, because I have a panicky&nbsp;fear of needles and&nbsp;until now&nbsp;I’ve been fixing my teeth without anaesthesia for 19 years.&nbsp;An acquaintance&nbsp;recommended the Lava Dental Clinic to me.&nbsp;I researched it on the internet and&nbsp;concluded&nbsp;that I had to go for a consultation.&nbsp;When I&nbsp;got&nbsp;here, I&nbsp;received a very warm welcome.&nbsp;The girls on the staff are fantastic and very nice!&nbsp;Before&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;appointment to correct&nbsp;my teeth,&nbsp;my insides were shaking, I felt as if&nbsp;I’d&nbsp;cry from fear, but before that I had to fill out a questionnaire with my wishes, where&nbsp;I&nbsp;mentioned that I’m paranoid about needles.&nbsp;I entered&nbsp;the office, lay down in fear and didn't even blink.&nbsp;But what surprised me was that, without my noticing, the dentist&nbsp;took the syringe and I didn't even feel that I was being injected.&nbsp;Of course,&nbsp;I shed a tear&nbsp;out&nbsp;of fear, but I&nbsp;needn’t have bothered, because&nbsp;there were no&nbsp;worries.&nbsp;I put on my headphones, choose my favourite Netflix series, and the&nbsp;dental treatment&nbsp;could&nbsp;begin!&nbsp;The best feeling, lying&nbsp;there for 2.5 hours,&nbsp;was that at some point you forget where you are, fall asleep,&nbsp;and&nbsp;at the same time you’re being taken care of with all the&nbsp;very latest&nbsp;modern innovations.&nbsp;The doctors do their job, I can even say, PERFECTLY, with care and love.&nbsp;Comparing&nbsp;my&nbsp;previous dental&nbsp;care&nbsp;and the appearance of&nbsp;my&nbsp;repaired teeth beforehand, the picture is&nbsp;akin to&nbsp;night and day!&nbsp;</p><p>I can definitely recommend this clinic and I’ll personally return here again and again whenever&nbsp;I need to&nbsp;in life.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Madara Freiberga</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;only dental clinic in my life that I’m&nbsp;happy to&nbsp;visit&nbsp;and spend money at!!&nbsp;[..]&nbsp;The&nbsp;staffare amazing!&nbsp;Incredibly nice people and professionals in their field!&nbsp;Words cannot describe it&nbsp;–&nbsp;you have to experience it, and I’m not afraid to recommend this dental clinic to anyone!&nbsp;</p><p>I wish you many productive years of work, dear Lava&nbsp;dental&nbsp;studio!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dace Krūziņa</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;very&nbsp;best place to get your teeth cleaned, the service and&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;are top&nbsp;class. Thank you!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Kristīne Kažoka</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A very calm and pleasant atmosphere.&nbsp;I felt&nbsp;as if I was&nbsp;in safe hands.&nbsp;Everything&nbsp;wasexplained&nbsp;to me,&nbsp;helping me&nbsp;to understand every detail of the treatment plan!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Lāsma Brenča</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Definitely the TOP clinic in Riga!!! I’d like to thank Dr. Vladislavs for&nbsp;a comprehensive&nbsp;visit, I’ll continue my treatment according to the&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;plan.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Deniss Rimavcevs</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A friendly welcome upon arrival, which already&nbsp;leaves&nbsp;you feeling&nbsp;cared&nbsp;for.&nbsp;Punctual appointment, which you’re&nbsp;always reminded&nbsp;about, if possible, offers different times for maintenance (which I really like).&nbsp;The doctors are competent,&nbsp;advise you on the best treatment plan and recommend what’s suitable or not&nbsp;for me.&nbsp;My favourite part&nbsp;is the&nbsp;headphones&nbsp;–&nbsp;I don't have to listen to&nbsp;my teeth&nbsp;being fixed, I&nbsp;just&nbsp;watch "FRIENDS" and sometimes&nbsp;even&nbsp;forget where I am.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Toms Talle</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Wonderful&nbsp;service and&nbsp;fantastic&nbsp;specialists!&nbsp;Surgeon Miroslav extracted my&nbsp;wisdom teeth very quickly, skilfully and painlessly.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dāvis Uļģis</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very pleasant service and professional doctors!&nbsp;I can 100% recommend Dr. Miroslav,&nbsp;mywisdom teeth surgery was very successful, painless&nbsp;with a fast&nbsp;rehabilitation process.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;visit&nbsp;I&nbsp;make&nbsp;is&nbsp;easy&nbsp;and stress-free.&nbsp;Thank you!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Evelina Avlasina</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Entering LAVA, the atmosphere was&nbsp;hard to put into words.&nbsp;From the smell, to the interior and the staff.&nbsp;I’d like to say a special thank you to hygienist Diāna Zamarina for&nbsp;her wonderful&nbsp;communication, and&nbsp;for doing an&nbsp;even better job!&nbsp;I’ll definitely&nbsp;return&nbsp;and recommend it!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Elina Vasiljeva</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very good dentists,&nbsp;who&nbsp;explain everything. No&nbsp;pain, no fear, everything’s comfortable and convenient, so much so that I could fall asleep in the dentist's chair!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Vitālijs Meija</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Extremely&nbsp;kind and pleasant service, friendly staff.&nbsp;Result and atmosphere 10/10,&nbsp;delighted&nbsp;to&nbsp;make return visits.&nbsp;Highly recommended!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Veronika Šteņa</div></div><!--]--></div><div class="feedback-reviews-box__footer"><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 7"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 8"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 9"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 10"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 11"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 12"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 13"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 14"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 15"></button><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="feedback-instagram u-bg-primary section-feedback__instagram"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-instagram__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our happy clients share their emotions on Instagram<!--]--></h2></div><div class="feedback-instagram__body"><div class="feedback-instagram-list"><!--[--><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="982" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/1-680x982.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/1-680x982.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/1-680x982.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="998" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/2-680x998.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/2-680x998.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/2-680x998.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="1015" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/3-680x1015.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/3-680x1015.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/3-680x1015.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="998" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/4-680x998.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/4-680x998.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/4-680x998.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="1027" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/6-680x1027.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/6-680x1027.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/6-680x1027.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="995" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/9-680x995.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/9-680x995.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/9-680x995.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="996" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/10-680x996.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/10-680x996.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/10-680x996.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="1113" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/11-680x1113.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/11-680x1113.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/11-680x1113.avif"></div><div class="feedback-instagram-list__item"><img width="680" height="1070" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/12-680x1070.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/12-680x1070.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image feedback-instagram-list__image" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/12-680x1070.avif"></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="feedback-instagram__footer"><a class="button button--type-primary button--icon-end" href="https://www.instagram.com/lavadentalstudio/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Follow us on Instagram<!--]--></div><!----></a></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-about-us" id="about-us" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about-us;"><div class="about-manifest u-bg-secondary"><div class="about-manifest__bg"><img width="1440" height="980" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1440px" srcset="/assets/img/3c76d766f5f4-foil-bg.avif 320w, /assets/img/4a915424ad55-foil-bg.avif 640w, /assets/img/8a64e80eb008-foil-bg.avif 1280w, /assets/img/52d2150f30d2-foil-bg.avif 1440w, /assets/img/0aba37dd0265-foil-bg.avif 2560w, /assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif 2880w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="about-manifest__bg-layer" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif"><img width="1440" height="980" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1440px" srcset="/assets/img/3c76d766f5f4-foil-bg.avif 320w, /assets/img/4a915424ad55-foil-bg.avif 640w, /assets/img/8a64e80eb008-foil-bg.avif 1280w, /assets/img/52d2150f30d2-foil-bg.avif 1440w, /assets/img/0aba37dd0265-foil-bg.avif 2560w, /assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif 2880w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="about-manifest__bg-layer" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/8f8b2e68ba96-foil-bg.avif"></div><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><div class="image-carousel"><div class="image-carousel__container"><!--[--><img src="/assets/img/e3547a40fe22-01.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style=""><img src="/assets/img/29eb5e829311-02.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c78fd0d7334c-03.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/7d7b6edefa96-04.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/e05ca2873721-05.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c5dac772c117-06.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused image-carousel__controls" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">In our care, you’ll receive not only treatment and a perfect smile, but also care, openness and support all the way to the result. Our mission is to change the perception of dentistry. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Music, ambiance and a finely designed interior together with a specially tailored atmosphere will enable you to experience a completely different dentistry — one that is comfortable, calm and inspiring.</p>
<p>We want your experience with us to be like flying in first class — personal, convenient and with no worries or stress.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Before you start, you might want to know more.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Diagnostics and treatment</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How long does the first complex diagnostic appointment take?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The first appointment lasts for about 30 minutes.\n\nThe second appointment (presentation of the treatment plan) takes up to 30 minutes.\n\nIf you live outside Latvia or are often travelling, the presentation appointment can be conducted remotely (on Zoom), while we help you plan your treatment appointments compactly.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What examinations are performed during complex diagnostics?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Visual examination of the oral cavity and teeth; Digital X-rays; Intraoral 3D scanning (3Shape, iTero Lumina); 3D computed tomography (CT); Diagnostic photo protocol.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is DSD - digital smile design?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>DSD is a method that allows you to envision the final result before treatment. It helps you find the perfect shape and proportions for your smile, highlights your individuality, harmonises your smile with your facial features, and makes you feel more confident.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How long will it take for my treatment plan to be prepared?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>On average, it takes five days. The precise length depends on the state of your oral cavity and treatment aims.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is a treatment plan coordinator?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A treatment plan coordinator is a specialist who ensures your treatment experience is clear and convenient. The coordinator helps you understand the treatment plan and costs, coordinate appointment times, answer practical questions, and focus on your health and smile.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.5s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Can I receive my appointment data?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, we send digital X-ray images to your email address. It is not technically possible to send intraoral images.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is it possible to receive a printed treatment plan?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, after the plan has been prepared, you will receive its financial section in printed form.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Services and prices</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How much do your services cost?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Prices depend on the type and complexity of treatment. The exact cost can only be determined after complex diagnostics. You can find prices for the most popular services in our Price List.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What solutions do you offer?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Exclusive veneers; Dental implants (Straumann, Neodent); Aligners (transparent crowns); All-ON-X solutions for multiple tooth loss; Professional hygiene and whitening (FLASH system); Aesthetic and therapeutic dentistry; Endodontics (root canal treatment under microscope control); Dental surgery.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is All-ON-X?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>All-ON-X is a method involving extraction of damaged teeth in one operation, insertion of 4 or 6 implants, and immediate loading of a fixed prosthesis. Treatment is usually performed under sedation. It is ideal for patients with multiple tooth loss or who need a complete set of dentures.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">Comfort and safety</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is treatment possible with no fear or discomfort?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, we offer treatment with sedation or general anaesthesia. Our leading anaesthesiologist ensures you are safe and comfortable so you feel calm and at peace.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is dental hygiene painful?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>No. We use the state-of-the-art EMS AIRFLOW Prophylaxis Master. It is a safe, precise, and comfortable method that removes plaque, pigments, and tartar without damaging tooth tissue.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title">About the clinic</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Why are you called a studio, not a clinic?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We want to change the perception of dentistry. A studio is a modern, beautiful, and cosy space with a peaceful atmosphere. It is where smiles are created as works of art with science, technology, and care for people.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Where is LAVA Dental Studio?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>You can find us at Ausekla Street 14 (1st floor), Riga. Parking in zone B is available, and we pay for it while you are in our studio.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is parking available for clients?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Although we do not have a private car park, we pay for parking in zone B nearby. Inform our team and we will take care of the rest.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section>
<section id="contacts" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-contacts;"><div class="contacts u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="contacts__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">We are right here. </h2></div><div class="contacts__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="740" height="627" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg 1x, /assets/img/dd2271325196-map.svg 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image-info-box__image" alt="Map" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Conveniently located to make your appointment even easier. With easy access for people with mobility impairments. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Our studio is located at Ausekļa Street 14, where there are parking spaces in Zone B. We will pay for your parking while you are at LAVA dental.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><!----></div></div><div class="contacts__footer"><img width="1290" height="590" data-nuxt-img="" sizes="(max-width: 639px) 100vw, (max-width: 1279px) 100vw, (max-width: 1349px) 100vw, 1290px" srcset="/assets/img/6be9b9a04821-location.avif 320w, /assets/img/936863dc2c1a-location.avif 640w, /assets/img/9f7348037191-location.avif 1280w, /assets/img/99bea6f7b10f-location.avif 1290w, /assets/img/4bbb139df2cb-location.avif 2560w, /assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif 2580w" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image" alt="LAVA Dental Studio" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/b86bd4d1f5a0-location.avif"></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></main>
